proposing the critical edition and the Italian translation of the &lt;i&gt;Story of Peter the Tax-Collector&lt;/i&gt;.</note></biblStruct><bibl type="formatted" subtype="bibliography" resp="https://www.zotero.org/styles/chicago-note-bibliography-17th-edition">
